ull,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124573","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124573","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124573.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124573.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #122176\n\n## Additional information\n\nCause of issue: box container measures the child minimum sizes using old cross axis dimensions. A Fit Width texture therefore uses its previous height, which keeps the label/container resizing loop out of sync.\n\nFix: Apply cross axis sizing before measuring minimum size in box container\n\nTesting: created a regression test with ai, tested pre patch and after, I also tested it manually on my machine (macOS 15.1 (24B83), Apple M1 MacBook Pro (MacBookPro17,1), 16 GB RAM.)","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"http